      "summaries": {
        "en": "Vault is an open-source secrets management system that solves the critical problem of securely storing and accessing sensitive data like API keys and passwords in modern applications. Its technical strength lies in a unified API that centralizes secrets storage while dynamically generating credentials with limited lifetimes, reducing exposure risks. Developers can integrate Vault into their infrastructure to manage database credentials, encrypt application data, and implement fine-grained access controls through its comprehensive CLI and HTTP API.",
        "zh": "Vault是一款开源密钥管理工具，专门解决现代应用中API密钥、密码等敏感数据的安全存储与访问难题。它通过统一API集中管理密钥，并采用动态生成短期凭证的机制，显著降低密钥泄露风险。技术亮点在于将静态密钥转换为按需生成的动态凭证，同时提供加密即服务功能。开发者可将其集成到基础设施中，用于管理数据库认证、加密应用数据，并通过详细的访问策略实现权限控制，适合构建安全可靠的云原生架构。",
        "es": "Vault is an open-source secrets management system that solves the critical problem of securely storing and accessing sensitive data like API keys and passwords in modern applications. Its technical strength lies in a unified API that centralizes secrets storage while dynamically generating credentials with limited lifetimes, reducing exposure risks. Developers can integrate Vault into their infrastructure to manage database credentials, encrypt application data, and implement fine-grained access controls through its comprehensive CLI and HTTP API.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "vault stands out for go, secrets, and vault in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "Vault is an open-source secrets management system that solves the critical problem of securely storing and accessing sensitive data like API keys and passwords in modern applications. Its technical strength lies in a unified API that centralizes secrets storage while dynamically generating credentials with limited lifetimes, reducing exposure risks. Developers can integrate Vault into their infrastructure to manage database credentials, encrypt application data, and implement fine-grained access controls through its comprehensive CLI and HTTP API.",
          "how": "Review https://github.com/hashicorp/vault for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
      },
